{"id":"s004_09","cat":"side","group":{"id":"side4","label":"EDEN SPEAR"},"label":"EDEN SPEAR: 9","stage":null,"prev":"s004_08","next":"s004_10","speakers":{"nihilister":"Nihilister","nayuta_n":"Nayuta","johan":"Johan"},"icons":{"nihilister":"si_c261_00_s","nayuta_n":"si_c9008_00_s","johan":"si_c925_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"s004_09_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_1","text":"You do know the Queen's not on the surface, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_Side_04_01_1","bgArt":"eventscene_side_04_01_1","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_chapter40_field_turningpoint","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_2","text":"Indeed, we do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_3","text":"Yeah, those white ones have been running around blabbering about killing the Queen so much, you'd have to be an idiot not to know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_4","text":"The Queen's in space,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_5","text":"still floating in her orbit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_6","text":"I don't know how many times she's gone around, but she just keeps circling.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_7","text":"I don't know why... she doesn't come down,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_8","text":"but I bet it's got something to do with why we stopped hearing her voice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_9","text":"Do the Heretics hear the Queen's voice, pray tell?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_10","text":"Yeah, but to be precise... it's not exactly a voice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_11","text":"It's more like... a command etched into our minds.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_12","text":"Haha, you human imposters wouldn't understand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_13","text":"Anyway, at some point, the voice just stopped.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_14","text":"It was as if some wall had sprung up between us... It gradually faded until we couldn't hear it anymore.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_15","text":"Liberalio pretended she could still hear it and used it to threaten us, but we all knew.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_16","text":"The Queen's out in space and can't influence us anymore.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_17","text":"It's been like that for a while, and I can't remember exactly when it started.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_18","text":"The elites wandering the surface bereft of their Queen... 'tis most curious.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_19","text":"Heh. Yeah, interesting, isn't it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_Side_04_01_2","bgArt":"eventscene_side_04_01_2","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_20","text":"Before the Queen went silent, we kept hearing the same words over and over:","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_21","text":"\"Find Lilith's body.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_22","text":"It wasn't just a command—it was a voice full of lingering emotions, almost a desperate plea.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_23","text":"Most of them ignored it since life on the surface was far too fun.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_24","text":"But me? I knew there had to be something there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_25","text":"... That voice was too unbearably heartrending.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_26","text":"So I started searching for Lilith's body.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_27","text":"And only recently, I finally found it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_28","text":"I have hearkened unto thy tale, Young Lady Fire Dragon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_29","text":"Pray, what is to follow?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_30","text":"The Queen wants Lilith's body.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_31","text":"The head alone won't satisfy her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_32","text":"If it were right in front of her, she'd snatch it into herself without hesitation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_33","text":"And from there, the possibilities are endless, aren't they?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_34","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_35","text":"Is the Queen a Heretic, verily?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_36","text":"Pretty much.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_37","text":"At least not in what she's made of.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_38","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_39","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_39","text":"Nayuta clasps her hands behind her back and slowly begins to pace.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_40","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_40","text":"She circles the room three times before stopping right where she started.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_41","text":".... Young Lady Fire Dragon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_42","text":"Verily, thy aim is...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_43","text":"to poison the Queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_44","text":"...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_45","text":"... What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_46","text":"If there be aught the Queen cannot forbear to take,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_47","text":"it shall be poisoned.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_48","text":"So it is. I hold it a most certain method.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_49","text":"And the poison is...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_50","text":"Vapaus.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_51","text":"... Ha...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_volcanicnest_a","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_52","text":"Haha!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_Side_04_01_5","bgArt":"eventscene_side_04_01_5","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_53","text":"Hahahahaha!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_54","text":"Right! That's it! That's exactly it!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_55","text":"If the Queen's composition be the same as the Heretics', then the greater part of her body consisteth of nanomachines.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_56","text":"Vapaus doth destroy nanomachines.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_57","text":"Thou wouldst place Vapaus within Lilith's body...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_58","text":"and hath the Queen absorb it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_59","text":"So it is. I see.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_60","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_61","text":"Ha...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_62","text":"Haha...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_63","text":"A plan most ingenious! Most ingenious, verily!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_64","text":"Haha, glad you like it!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_65","text":"Perfect! That speeds things up!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_66","text":"You've got Vapaus, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_67","text":"Hand it over! No, let's use it together!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_68","text":"Fill the goblet—Lilith's body, which I've prepared—","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_69","text":"with the poison, Vapaus!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_70","text":"Let's kill","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s004_09_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister","key":"Locale_SideStory:s004_09_71","text":"the Queen!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}